# SOURCE-DOMAIN-GUARD

Canonical contract: [SOURCE-DOMAIN-MODEL-001.md](../../SOURCE-DOMAIN-MODEL-001.md) — **FROZEN · CORE**. Further domain changes require an ADR.

React components never derive:

- lifecycle
- health
- capabilities
- actions
- badges

React consumes `SourcePresentation` only.

Feature code never branches on `host === 'browser'`, `isWeb`, or a handle type.
It asks `SourceCapabilities` and `HostAccessCapabilities`.

Domain decisions belong exclusively to the Source Domain Model
(`source-identity.ts`, `source-handle.ts`, `source-health.ts`, `source-lifecycle.ts`, `source-actions.ts`, `source-capabilities.ts`, `platform-capabilities.ts`).
Copy belongs to `source-presentation.ts`.
